        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ kuungaá múk Israeli, nun sakwasleemuút. Umuú heewo un sakwasleemuút ar harqoomoó tlehhmi'iiwós. Hhu'uu'umé' nee tlakweema tlehhtuuwo mawaak, tlakweemaahúng munduwa hhaamiisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlakweemaahúng kwisíng taa tlehhité' amór saaw ti kwahhe'. Muunuú hhoó' nee qeeruú /abén slawaak. Xáy múk Israeli, ahaá waáy, gár tas hhaanda'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng gwa'ara tam ar heé wák a saqwalala/aaká. Gawaá adoorihe hhu'uu'umé' as tawa hota'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
